+# Audit commands
+
+The evidence logs were produced with these commands from `/audit-output`.
+
+```bash
+PYTHONPATH=/reference python3 evidence/inventory_audit.py
+PYTHONPATH=/reference python3 evidence/hash_and_manifest_audit.py
